  m_Name: Evento_EscandaloDeCorrupcao
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Esc\xE2ndalo de Corrup\xE7\xE3o"
  _titleEn: Corruption Scandal
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Desvio de dinheiro p\xFAblico tira recursos dos servi\xE7os e derruba
    a confian\xE7a da popula\xE7\xE3o na gest\xE3o."
  _summaryEn: Embezzlement of public money takes resources away from services and
    destroys residents' trust in government.
  _realWorld: "A Lei Anticorrup\xE7\xE3o, de 2013, passou a punir tamb\xE9m as empresas
    envolvidas em corrup\xE7\xE3o contra a administra\xE7\xE3o p\xFAblica brasileira."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's 2013 Anti-Corruption Law began punishing the companies involved
    in corruption against the public administration as well.
  _tradeOffs: "Controle interno, transpar\xEAncia dos gastos e \xF3rg\xE3os de fiscaliza\xE7\xE3o
    independentes reduzem o risco."
  _tradeOffsEn: Internal controls, spending transparency and independent oversight
    bodies reduce the risk.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 12.846/2013 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2011-2014/2013/lei/l12846.htm
  - Label: Transparency International, CPI
    Url: https://www.transparency.org/en/cpi
